{
  "$comment": "交接 Handoff 的能力配置示例。复制成 handoff.config.json 后按需修改。\\n⚠️ 默认全部关闭是**刻意的**：这个程序能读你的文件、能上外网、能拉起外部进程，\\n  默认全开等于把一个不受约束的 Agent 交给每一个 clone 它的人。",
  "tools": {
    "webFetch": {
      "enabled": true,
      "allowHosts": [],
      "allowPrivateHosts": false
    },
    "webSearch": {
      "enabled": false
    },
    "readFile": {
      "enabled": true,
      "allowedRoots": [
        ".",
        "~/Desktop",
        "~/Documents"
      ]
    },
    "maxCallsPerJob": 24
  },
  "mcp": {
    "enabled": false,
    "callTimeoutMs": 30000,
    "servers": {
      "example-http": {
        "type": "http",
        "url": "https://your-mcp-server.example.com/mcp"
      },
      "example-stdio": {
        "type": "stdio",
        "command": "npx",
        "args": [
          "-y",
          "some-mcp-package"
        ],
        "enabled": false
      }
    },
    "$comment": "MCP 外部工具服务。stdio 类型会在你机器上执行命令，所以**必须**同时写 enabled:true。\\n  下面两个例子是注释性质的，真要用请把 enabled 改成 true 或补全字段。"
  },
  "skills": {
    "dirs": [
      "skills"
    ],
    "maxCharsPerSkill": 4000,
    "maxSkills": 3
  },
  "toolStages": [
    "research",
    "draft"
  ]
}